  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You came of age in the beating heart of a great city such as Baldur's Gate. You spent countless nights in taverns, theaters, salons, and gambling dens, enjoying everything the city had to offer. You have a natural gift for drawing secrets out of people, whether over a high-stakes game or at an elegant soirée. You may have been thrown out of an establishment or ten, but only by people who don't know how to have a good time.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.8AAspyuQktrLqNUH]{Tireless Reveler}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Deception and Persuasion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, Gaming Set (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBottleGlass]{Glass Bottle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPerfume0000]{Perfume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, 19 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
